### 영역 C: 에러 처리 모듈 (신규)

**신규 파일**: `stdlib_result.fl` (+200줄)
```freeLang
# Result 패턴
fn ok(value: any): map { return {"ok": true, "value": value, "error": null} }
fn err(message: string): map { return {"ok": false, "value": null, "error": message} }
fn is_ok(result: map): bool { return result["ok"] }
fn is_err(result: map): bool { return not result["ok"] }
fn unwrap(result: map): any { ... }
fn unwrap_or(result: map, default: any): any { ... }
fn result_map(result: map, fn): map { ... }
fn result_and_then(result: map, fn): map { ... }
```

